Qwen3.8-Flash-Next with image input on one DGX Spark (Hibana)

This recipe builds on two projects:

1. dedene/Hibana-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-DGX-Spark (https://github.com/dedene/Hibana-Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-DGX-Spark),
   commit 6948e9b, MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 Peter Dedene. The Dockerfile, compose.yaml, tools/download.sh,
   tools/serve.sh, tools/check.py and patches/0001-tool-args-anyof.patch come from it. This recipe changes
   compose.yaml, tools/serve.sh, tools/check.py, .env.example and the Dockerfile.

2. Hibana (https://github.com/sharar-project/hibana), commit d474b74, Apache License 2.0, by Yahya Emara,
   Chi-Chih Chang and the Abdelfattah Lab at Cornell. Hibana is downloaded and built inside the image; it is not
   copied into this repository.

   patches/0002-flashnext-vision.patch, patches/0003-vision-speculation-graphs.patch and
   patches/0004-v1.1-exact-speed-stack.patch modify Hibana source files.
   As required by section 4(b) of the Apache License 2.0: these patches change files under hibana/ (api/, engine/, kernels/,
   model/ and proposers/; each patch lists the files it touches). The modified files stay under the Apache
   License 2.0. The patches are offered under the same license.

The model weights are not part of this repository. Qwen3.8-Flash-Next is by the Qwen team; the NVFP4 checkpoint is
by RadixArk; Hibana's 3-bit copies are by the Hibana authors. Each carries its own license on its model card.
